  <description>
    <p>MomentStays converts Android Motion Photos to Apple Live Photos and Apple Live Photos to Android Motion Photos, keeping the video stream and the cover moment. Source files are only read.</p>
    <p>Supported static HDR photos are exported as stills. Bursts are experimental: Android to Apple only, JPEG only, for Google, Samsung and known Huawei/Honor formats. Private HDR conversion is experimental and off by default.</p>
